{"2489250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meatgrinder", "steam_appid": 2489250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a survivor in the post-apocalyptic world, having to traverse the dangerous wasteland to return to your hometown. However, the wasteland is filled with hostile mutated creatures and out-of-control intelligence, and you also have to face extremely harsh and unforgiving environments. You can only rely on yourself to assemble an armored vehicle to deal with the dangers and drive it to your destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will recover various resources and search for the way back to your hometown in a post-apocalyptic world where out-of-control machinery and mutated creatures are wreaking havoc.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can assemble your own mech as many times as you want using different components.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/5504b79466669df1ef7cfa4dc2a47de5.poster.avif?t=1772124964\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/5504b79466669df1ef7cfa4dc2a47de5.webm?t=1772124964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/5504b79466669df1ef7cfa4dc2a47de5.mp4?t=1772124964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use quantum technology to transform the volume and mass of any unit to assist in combat or decryption.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/c0f736f2